   "Product" means the Base Product or a Module, as the context requires. This
   Agreement applies separately to each Product You license.

   "Update" means any later release of a Product You have licensed — bug fixes,
   improvements, new hardware support, and new functionality within that
   Product — however it is numbered or named.

   "Reseller" means an authorised sales platform through which the Software is
