12. TERM AND TERMINATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   Each Commercial Licence is perpetual unless terminated under this Section.

   A licence terminates automatically if You materially breach this Agreement in
   respect of that Product and do not cure the breach within thirty (30) days of
