   Termination is per Product. Losing Your licence to one Module does not affect
   the Base Product or any other Module — except that a Module cannot be used
   without a licensed Base Product, so termination of the Base Product licence
   stops the Modules with it.

   Sections 5, 6, 7, 10, 11, and 13 survive termination.

